<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais leads 9.5 bln FFR 3-tranche bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais leads 9.5 bln FFR 3-tranche bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Titrilog has issued a three-tranche securitisation of mortgage loans to individuals for a total of 9.5 billion French francs, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>Tranches A1 and A2 total 4.3938 billion francs each. A third subordinated tranche is for 712.5 million francs.  </p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p>TRANCHE A1</p>
<p> AMT    4.3938	  BASE	 3M-PIBOR  LEGAL MAT     .JAN.18</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +5 BP     PAY DATE    04.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.10</p>
<p> NOTES	EXPECTED MATURITY 25.JAN.01. AVG LIFE 1.75</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p>TRANCHE A2</p>
<p> AMT    4.3938	  BASE	 3M-PIBOR  LEGAL MAT     .JAN.18</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +15 BP    PAY DATE    04.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> NOTES	EXPECTED MATURITY 25.JUL.06. AVG LIFE 6.386</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE ARE ALSO TRANCHE B SUBORDINATED NOTES OF 712.5</p>
<p>		MLN FFR, PAYING PIBOR +40 BP, RATED A3 BY MOODY'S</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
